# blob 依赖（SOURCE_CONFIRMED，见 PATCH_SERIES_DEPENDENCY_MAP.md）：
#   MASTER.arm64.bcm2837  : b1674966 (runner-11 之后) -> fa3d43f7
#   apple_arm64_cpu.h     : e462ede9 (上游原始)       -> f50881e6
